From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tu: use 512 KiB pipeline BOs in FF7R SD865 profile

The existing 512 KiB profile patch was authored against a different Mesa
source layout and does not apply to the pinned FF7R experiment commit.
Keep that existing profile patch unchanged and apply the same narrowly
scoped A650 suballocator-size change with minimal context for this pinned
source profile.

No other GPU, rendering mode, or program-state behavior is changed.

---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_device.cc
@@ -2582,1 +2582,2 @@
-      &device->pipeline_suballoc, device, 128 * 1024,
+      &device->pipeline_suballoc, device,
+      (fd_dev_gpu_id(&physical_device->dev_id) == 650 ? 512 : 128) * 1024,
